  ('4.15.21.4.2', 'Engagement of Community structures (WDC, CSO, Religious leaders, Youth leaders, women groups) 2 per wards on Climatic change resilience through early warning, detection and response to climate linked acute health emergencies', 10657500.00::numeric, 589),
